   "bbox": [
    56.0,
    110.0,
    537.8,
    141.4
   ],
   "content": "GreenGrid operates solar farms and onshore wind parks across North Africa and Southern Europe. In 2025 we focused on grid reliability, storage and operating cost reduction.",
   "caption": "",
   "image_path": null
  },
  {
   "id": "p1-text-3",
   "type": "text",
   "page": 1,
   "bbox": [
    56.0,
    210.0,
    518.8,
    257.6
   ],
   "content": "Production followed seasonal patterns: solar rises in the warm months while wind is stronger in winter. Detailed quarterly figures are shown in Figure 1 on the next page. We do not restate the individual numbers in the text.",
   "caption": "",
   "image_path": null
  },
  {
   "id": "p1-text-4",
   "type": "text",
   "page": 1,
   "bbox": [
    56.0,
    310.0,
    526.8,
    341.4
   ],
   "content": "Outlook: we plan to add battery storage at three sites in 2026 and extend predictive maintenance to every turbine. There were no lost-time incidents during the year.",
   "caption": "",
   "image_path": null
  },
